- [Japan PM orders cabinet to compile relief package to combat rising prices](https://www.investing.com/news/economy/japan-pm-orders-cabinet-to-compile-relief-package-to-combat-rising-prices-2793471) - Reuters via Investing.com, 2022-03-28. Kishida ordered a fresh relief package to cushion fuel and raw-material price shocks, with gasoline subsidies and other support for households and firms. This is a concrete shock-management choice. Temporal fit: early 2022 Ukraine-driven inflation shock. Ruler attribution: direct Kishida instruction to cabinet. Contrary points: relief/subsidies are defensive and temporary, not structural productivity reform. Lenses: 5B.3, 5B.9, 5B.10.
